    "model": "Two of three signers with a one-hour delay and a fourteen-day grace period after it. Proposing counts as the proposer's approval. A proposer can withdraw its own proposal; anyone else's takes two vetoes. The guardian can pause the escrow, the oracle registry and the agent registry in the same block and can do nothing else.",
