      "MandateAccountFactory": "No admin role.",
      "Staking": "AdminTimelock v1 (0x5a32Eab02454f97a39857E85b536F83EE0f844Bf). The resolver allowlist is v1 proposals 4 to 7: floors of 25,000 BRSR for resolver-1, resolver-2 and resolver-3, then a minimum bond of 1,000,000,000 BRSR for everyone else."
